  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "作曲講座目次",
      "sourceHash": "63852873942314f84b95325b3847b0ec237666f4f0b1b6d7b0602c59936ef6ed",
      "translation": "Table of Contents for the Music Composition Guide",
      "contextHash": "63852873942314f84b95325b3847b0ec237666f4f0b1b6d7b0602c59936ef6ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ついに作曲講座を作ってしまいました。といっても、作った当人はＲＰＧ制作の片手間で作曲しているだけのアマチュアです。",
      "sourceHash": "18de47b11bf57269645d2b0159452ad8daa72a6d4c40fff854088ae7b3fd0c5b",
      "translation": "I finally went ahead and created a music composition guide. That said, I’m just an amateur who composes music in my spare time while working on RPG design.",
      "contextHash": "18de47b11bf57269645d2b0159452ad8daa72a6d4c40fff854088ae7b3fd0c5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "テーマは『誰でも初めて一日で曲が作れる作曲講座』です。興味ある方はお試しください。何よりも手っ取り早く曲が作れることを目指していますので、音楽理論的に正確なものは期待しないでください。",
      "sourceHash": "3878522f2bf02e786e265b8677626bbf88d5ada2e64ac6781b0dff94ae4e7dd7",
      "translation": "The theme is “A Music Composition Guide Anyone Can Use to Create Their First Song in One Day.” If you’re interested, give it a try. Above all, I’m aiming to help you create a song as quickly as possible, so don’t expect strict accuracy from a music theory perspective.",
      "contextHash": "3878522f2bf02e786e265b8677626bbf88d5ada2e64ac6781b0dff94ae4e7dd7"
    }
  ],
